cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the paper below."
title: "RMMC: Robust Multi-Matrix Completion via Hybrid Ordinary-Welsch Loss"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation, baselines (MMC, RMC-HOW, RMC-l0, RTCUR, TriTD,
  RGNMR), experiment programs and the ORL dataset for robust multi-matrix
  completion with the hybrid ordinary-Welsch loss: a collection of matrices
  sharing a row and a column subspace is restored when whole rows or columns
  are missing and the observed entries are also corrupted by outliers.
